    "show_share": true,
    "description": "A new study by researchers at Aga Khan University has highlighted the need to improve ways to diagnose and treat pneumonia, a leading cause of death in children under five around the world. The study was  published in The New England Journal of Medicine, NEJM,  the most prestigious and highly cited medical journal in the world.",
